  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Security - Climate Nexus in Gedaref, Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to peace and stability in Gedaref by strengthening community resilience to conflict factors exacerbated by disaster and environmental degradation, as well as to assist the Government of Sudan in implementing the Juba Peace Agreement (JPA), which remains relevant for Sudan following the military takeover attempt on October 25, the Common Country Analysis (CCA), and the Sudan Peacemaking, Peacebuilding, and Stabilization Program (SPPSP).</narrative>
  </description>
